#: src/3875-build-std-explicit-dependencies.md:6
msgid "Summary"
msgstr ""

#: src/3875-build-std-explicit-dependencies.md:9
msgid ""
"Allow users to add explicit dependencies on standard library crates in the "
"`Cargo.toml`. This enables Cargo to determine which standard library crates "
"are required by the crate graph without `build-std.crates` being set and for "
"different crates to require different standard library crates."
msgstr ""

#: src/3875-build-std-explicit-dependencies.md:14
msgid ""
"**This RFC is is part of the [build-std project goal](https://rust-lang."
"github.io/rust-project-goals/2025h2/build-std.html) and a series of build-"
"std RFCs:**"
msgstr ""

