#: src/3875-build-std-explicit-dependencies.md:444
msgid ""
"String containing name of the `builtin` package. Can shadow the names of "
"other packages in the registry (except those packages in the `deps` key of "
"the current package) ([?](#why-can-builtin_deps-shadow-other-packages-in-the-"
"registry))"
